---
import InteriorPage from '../../components/InteriorPage.astro';
---

<InteriorPage
  title="Brand & Credits"
  eyebrow="Credits"
  description="Design credits for this unofficial ISRO website redesign concept."
  lede="A portfolio demonstrator. Not affiliated with ISRO or the Department of Space."
>
  <aside class="disclaimer" role="note">
    <p>
      Unofficial fan / concept work only. Do not treat this site as an official Government of India
      or ISRO property.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <h2>Logotype</h2>
  <p>
    The ISRO wordmark used is inspired from
    {' '}
    <a
      href="https://www.behance.net/gallery/91862335/Rebranding-ISRO-Indian-Space-Research-Organisation"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
    >
      Swarna Manjari's ISRO rebranding study
    </a>
    {' '}
    on Behance. Credit belongs to her.
  </p>

  <h2>3D model</h2>
  <p>
    Gaganyaan spacecraft model by
    {' '}
    <a
      href="https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/isro-gaganyaan-animated-solar-panel-962a218eb4394890bfa55ab1e6b233e7"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
    >
      the3dCartel
    </a>
    {' '}
    on Sketchfab, embedded on the homepage Mission in focus section.
  </p>

  <h2>Type</h2>
  <p>
    Space Grotesk (display), IBM Plex Sans (body), JetBrains Mono (labels), Noto Sans Devanagari
    (Hindi) in the redesign theme.
  </p>
  <p>
    The UX4G theme toggle mirrors tokens from the official
    {' '}
    <a href="https://www.ux4g.gov.in/?lang=en" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      UX4G Design System
    </a>
    {' '}
    (indigo brand primary, Noto Sans / Noto Sans Display, light government canvas). Not affiliated
    with MeitY / UX4G.
  </p>

  <h2>Source</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="https://www.isro.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">isro.gov.in</a>
    {' '}
    (content source)
  </p>

  <h2>Built by</h2>
  <p>Abdul Waheed Khan Sowdagar: concept redesign for portfolio demonstration.</p>
</InteriorPage>

<style lang="scss">
  .disclaimer {
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--saffron);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);

    p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
  }
</style>
